(5552533, 803487, 102386, '<td valign="top">This isn''t a bad shot, but just too familiar. I understand the problem with not having interesting subjects on your doorstep, but in my opinion the subject has been milked enough. Going to have to vote this down. I try to be consistent regarding the matter.</td>', 'This isn''t a bad shot, but just too familiar. I understand the problem with not having interesting subjects on your doorstep, but in my opinion the subject has been milked enough. Going to have to vote this down. I try to be consistent regarding the matter.', '2009-07-01 06:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
