(5552653, 802404, 83313, '<td valign="top">The treatment and crop worked well. The Topaz enhances it, but is not over the top and obvious. Might have benefited from some selective noise reduction applied to the sky. It''s a touch grainy and you know how nitpicky voters can be, especially in a freestudy where perfection is the standard. (No vote, comment only)</td>', 'The treatment and crop worked well. The Topaz enhances it, but is not over the top and obvious. Might have benefited from some selective noise reduction applied to the sky. It''s a touch grainy and you know how nitpicky voters can be, especially in a freestudy where perfection is the standard. (No vote, comment only)', '2009-07-01 08:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
