(5552930, 802408, 44877, '<td valign="top">Very pretty with the foggy vignette and the beautiful colors. I feel the frame takes away from the ethereal quality of the image. Would have done better without.</td>', 'Very pretty with the foggy vignette and the beautiful colors. I feel the frame takes away from the ethereal quality of the image. Would have done better without.', '2009-07-01 11:27:19.000000', NULL, 1),
