(5552934, 803488, 98339, '<td valign="top">I really like the blue in this with the bruised clouds, but the water in the foreground has many funny specks in it...not sure why...might be ice floating</td>', 'I really like the blue in this with the bruised clouds, but the water in the foreground has many funny specks in it...not sure why...might be ice floating', '2009-07-01 11:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
