(5552938, 802803, 44877, '<td valign="top">This is, of course, darling. Especially the look you captured on the dogs'' faces. However, it does have a snapshot quality, which is too bad. Perhaps a closer crop and some intensification of the tones with levels or curves - or the whole image in BW - would have taken it up a notch.</td>', 'This is, of course, darling. Especially the look you captured on the dogs'' faces. However, it does have a snapshot quality, which is too bad. Perhaps a closer crop and some intensification of the tones with levels or curves - or the whole image in BW - would have taken it up a notch.', '2009-07-01 11:30:14.000000', NULL, 1),
