(5554103, 802562, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very good lighting, a nice portrait. Did you soften her face too much I wonder?</td>', 'Very good lighting, a nice portrait. Did you soften her face too much I wonder?', '2009-07-01 17:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5554105, 798070, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very pretty flowers. Was the grain intentional?</td>', 'Very pretty flowers. Was the grain intentional?', '2009-07-01 17:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5554109, 803014, 103032, '<td valign="top">The leading lines of the bottom left is good.  But there''s a lot of dead space on the right side of the image.  Maybe cropping out some of the right would have helped, or trying a portrait framing instead of the landscape framing.  Maybe cropping out the right half down the center of the walkway so that the lighthouse is emphasized.  The fog creates another problem in that the lighthouse (the main subject) is muted so that the visual impact of the lighthouse gets lost.  I''m not a big post processor so I don''t know what could have been done to brighten up the teal color of the lighthouse.  If the lighthouse could have been "brightened up", that may have made this a stronger image.  Good luck on the voting.</td>', 'The leading lines of the bottom left is good.  But there''s a lot of dead space on the right side of the image.  Maybe cropping out some of the right would have helped, or trying a portrait framing instead of the landscape framing.  Maybe cropping out the right half down the center of the walkway so that the lighthouse is emphasized.  The fog creates another problem in that the lighthouse (the main subject) is muted so that the visual impact of the lighthouse gets lost.  I''m not a big post processor so I don''t know what could have been done to brighten up the teal color of the lighthouse.  If the lighthouse could have been "brightened up", that may have made this a stronger image.  Good luck on the voting.', '2009-07-01 17:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5554110, 801875, 92577, '<td valign="top">epic!</td>', 'epic!', '2009-07-01 17:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5554115, 802965, 98339, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and tones in this and the cows in the background, but I don''t like the tree dead centered....</td>', 'I like the colors and tones in this and the cows in the background, but I don''t like the tree dead centered....', '2009-07-01 17:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5554118, 803312, 92577, '<td valign="top">wow! - and that''s one of only a couple of wows so far...</td>', 'wow! - and that''s one of only a couple of wows so far...', '2009-07-01 17:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5554121, 803299, 98339, '<td valign="top">though this is an amazing shot to have even captured the lightning to me it is way to dark in exposure...</td>', 'though this is an amazing shot to have even captured the lightning to me it is way to dark in exposure...', '2009-07-01 17:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5554125, 799536, 98339, '<td valign="top">those eyes look like "devil eyes"...a very different picture indeed...to be honest...this kind of shot doesn''t appeal to me...I''m more the landscape...flowers kind of gal...mind you it''s not a bad shot...just not up my ally</td>', 'those eyes look like "devil eyes"...a very different picture indeed...to be honest...this kind of shot doesn''t appeal to me...I''m more the landscape...flowers kind of gal...mind you it''s not a bad shot...just not up my ally', '2009-07-01 17:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
