(5554128, 802386, 100393, '<td valign="top">Bold! I love it.</td>', 'Bold! I love it.', '2009-07-01 17:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5554130, 802645, 98339, '<td valign="top">I assume that this is a HDR shot...you give me pause for thought...not sure what to make of the deep shadows to the left, but I like how it opens up at the top where there is more light and detail that isn''t lost...</td>', 'I assume that this is a HDR shot...you give me pause for thought...not sure what to make of the deep shadows to the left, but I like how it opens up at the top where there is more light and detail that isn''t lost...', '2009-07-01 17:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5554133, 803449, 98339, '<td valign="top">well that is vivid to say the least....such a wonderful abstract</td>', 'well that is vivid to say the least....such a wonderful abstract', '2009-07-01 17:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5554135, 802960, 92577, '<td valign="top">seems there must have been a crowd at this location - great shot</td>', 'seems there must have been a crowd at this location - great shot', '2009-07-01 17:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5554140, 802562, 98339, '<td valign="top">really like this alot...one thing...you cropped out her hair on the top...doesn''t count against you but your colors are quite nice...well done</td>', 'really like this alot...one thing...you cropped out her hair on the top...doesn''t count against you but your colors are quite nice...well done', '2009-07-01 17:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5554146, 803353, 103032, '<td valign="top">The image looks muted.  The model "blends"/gets lost into the background.  For me, there''s too much dead space to the left.  Maybe a tighter crop from her shoulders up and different lighting would have helped in this image.  Just not a lot of visual interest...  IMHO.</td>', 'The image looks muted.  The model "blends"/gets lost into the background.  For me, there''s too much dead space to the left.  Maybe a tighter crop from her shoulders up and different lighting would have helped in this image.  Just not a lot of visual interest...  IMHO.', '2009-07-01 17:51:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5554147, 801689, 100393, '<td valign="top">Great shot - probably too good to crop this tightly though.</td>', 'Great shot - probably too good to crop this tightly though.', '2009-07-01 17:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5554151, 801375, 103032, '<td valign="top">This is nice in B&amp;W.  Nice contrast.</td>', 'This is nice in B&W.  Nice contrast.', '2009-07-01 17:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5554159, 801464, 100393, '<td valign="top">Very well done.</td>', 'Very well done.', '2009-07-01 17:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5554171, 800355, 100393, '<td valign="top">Really excellent work.</td>', 'Really excellent work.', '2009-07-01 17:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5554175, 801421, 98339, '<td valign="top">ok, first off...it is so very centered...up/down left/right (maybe not so up/down) but my first thought is - what is to the left/right of the picture...would that add interest or not...you have sharp focus and your processing isn''t lacking...but your choice of subject... doesn''t wow me...sorry</td>', 'ok, first off...it is so very centered...up/down left/right (maybe not so up/down) but my first thought is - what is to the left/right of the picture...would that add interest or not...you have sharp focus and your processing isn''t lacking...but your choice of subject... doesn''t wow me...sorry', '2009-07-01 17:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5554176, 802432, 98339, '<td valign="top">this shot has so much potential...your subjects either need to be darker (silhouettes) or they need to have more light on them...to me it is underexposed</td>', 'this shot has so much potential...your subjects either need to be darker (silhouettes) or they need to have more light on them...to me it is underexposed', '2009-07-01 17:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5554178, 803517, 103032, '<td valign="top">Focus is too soft.  Looks like a lot of noise too.  The right side of her head looks like noise or grain but not, maybe weird attempt of use of an overlay...  The subject looks like a great character study but the image just doesn''t look quite right.  Sorry to be so critical.</td>', 'Focus is too soft.  Looks like a lot of noise too.  The right side of her head looks like noise or grain but not, maybe weird attempt of use of an overlay...  The subject looks like a great character study but the image just doesn''t look quite right.  Sorry to be so critical.', '2009-07-01 17:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5554179, 800205, 103032, '<td valign="top">Nice focus on her face, nice DOF.</td>', 'Nice focus on her face, nice DOF.', '2009-07-01 17:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5554181, 801312, 100393, '<td valign="top">Looks like something would take the blue in ''High Contrast''. I hope it does well for you here too.</td>', 'Looks like something would take the blue in ''High Contrast''. I hope it does well for you here too.', '2009-07-01 17:59:52.000000', NULL, 1);
