(5554513, 800259, 13749, '<td valign="top">Not sure if the dodging around her is intended to give her a glow, but it more seems to make the post-processing more noticeable.  From the dodged area, it looks like the colors were really great to begin with- but I think the rest is a bit too burned/darkened with respect to the subject.</td>', 'Not sure if the dodging around her is intended to give her a glow, but it more seems to make the post-processing more noticeable.  From the dodged area, it looks like the colors were really great to begin with- but I think the rest is a bit too burned/darkened with respect to the subject.', '2009-07-01 19:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5554523, 797692, 43774, '<td valign="top">Cute but a bit overexposed/washed out.</td>', 'Cute but a bit overexposed/washed out.', '2009-07-01 19:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5554525, 801093, 43774, '<td valign="top">Almost looks real!!</td>', 'Almost looks real!!', '2009-07-01 19:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
