(5554996, 803551, 101117, '<td valign="top">I''m torn on the processing for this one. My initial reaction was that I liked it, and I usually go with that, but very quickly afterwards when looking at this I began to think I didn''t like the amount of white across the top.<br/> <br/>You have managed to capture an "old fashioned" look here, which I believe is what you are going for, but I just can''t make up my mind if I like it or not. I''m going to give this a 6 for now, but I may come back and alter that in either direction depending how this one settles with me!<br/> <br/>Came back to say that I''ve upped this to a 7 vote, I think this is a touch bright on screen but would look great on print.</td>', 'I''m torn on the processing for this one. My initial reaction was that I liked it, and I usually go with that, but very quickly afterwards when looking at this I began to think I didn''t like the amount of white across the top. You have managed to capture an "old fashioned" look here, which I believe is what you are going for, but I just can''t make up my mind if I like it or not. I''m going to give this a 6 for now, but I may come back and alter that in either direction depending how this one settles with me! Came back to say that I''ve upped this to a 7 vote, I think this is a touch bright on screen but would look great on print.', '2009-07-01 23:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
