(5556258, 803474, 103032, '<td valign="top">Pretty cute subjects, nice composition.  Looks a bit soft focus on my screen, maybe intentional for the subject?  Lighting looks pretty good.  Good luck.</td>', 'Pretty cute subjects, nice composition.  Looks a bit soft focus on my screen, maybe intentional for the subject?  Lighting looks pretty good.  Good luck.', '2009-07-02 18:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5556333, 803548, 103032, '<td valign="top">Actually a nice contemplative portrait.  Great DOF.  I like the choice of going B&amp;W, helps the "mood."  I think just a little bit of adjustment on the composition so that the edge of the right side of her hair/head were completely in the photo would have been better.  Also, a totally personal preference would be to have her lips together/mouth closed.  But thats just me.  Nice portrait, good luck.</td>', 'Actually a nice contemplative portrait.  Great DOF.  I like the choice of going B&W, helps the "mood."  I think just a little bit of adjustment on the composition so that the edge of the right side of her hair/head were completely in the photo would have been better.  Also, a totally personal preference would be to have her lips together/mouth closed.  But thats just me.  Nice portrait, good luck.', '2009-07-02 19:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
