(5556411, 799335, 103032, '<td valign="top">I like the shot/subjects for what it is, I like the composition.  I know getting exposure right is tough with bright sun, bright water/waves.  So take this for what it''s worth:  Looks like you pumped up the contrast too much, maybe saturation too.  The outcropping of rocks and the dogs end up just silhouettes.  It just looks over processed.  If you''ve been on DPC any amount of time, you know how harsh the viewers can be and the highly skilled post processors get the better scores.  Good luck on this and future challenges.</td>', 'I like the shot/subjects for what it is, I like the composition.  I know getting exposure right is tough with bright sun, bright water/waves.  So take this for what it''s worth:  Looks like you pumped up the contrast too much, maybe saturation too.  The outcropping of rocks and the dogs end up just silhouettes.  It just looks over processed.  If you''ve been on DPC any amount of time, you know how harsh the viewers can be and the highly skilled post processors get the better scores.  Good luck on this and future challenges.', '2009-07-02 19:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
