(5556495, 802223, 43774, '<td valign="top">She is so cute! What a sweet picture although there seems to be a bit too much glow/softening on her face.</td>', 'She is so cute! What a sweet picture although there seems to be a bit too much glow/softening on her face.', '2009-07-02 19:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
