(5556547, 802023, 103032, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF.  I like how her blue dress counters the neutral tones of the field and adds balance to the sky. The subject''s "pose" looks casual, relaxed, and playful.  Nice job.</td>', 'Nice DOF.  I like how her blue dress counters the neutral tones of the field and adds balance to the sky. The subject''s "pose" looks casual, relaxed, and playful.  Nice job.', '2009-07-02 20:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5556549, 800507, 103032, '<td valign="top">Has the makings of a DrArchoo pic.  What can I say, this is a top 5% DPC type of pic.  Nice job on all aspects; subject, comp, and technicals.</td>', 'Has the makings of a DrArchoo pic.  What can I say, this is a top 5% DPC type of pic.  Nice job on all aspects; subject, comp, and technicals.', '2009-07-02 20:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5556552, 802635, 103032, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is an awesome action pic.  Perfect composition, great focus, good DOF.  Nice job.</td>', 'Wow, this is an awesome action pic.  Perfect composition, great focus, good DOF.  Nice job.', '2009-07-02 20:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5556560, 802698, 103032, '<td valign="top">Well done.  Composition is great, colors are brilliant, focus is crisp.  I think DPC type top 10% finisher.</td>', 'Well done.  Composition is great, colors are brilliant, focus is crisp.  I think DPC type top 10% finisher.', '2009-07-02 20:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5556563, 803390, 103032, '<td valign="top">This is nice.  I like the B&amp;W treatment.  This would make a great print.</td>', 'This is nice.  I like the B&W treatment.  This would make a great print.', '2009-07-02 20:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5556567, 802790, 103032, '<td valign="top">This is cool.  Awesome composition.  I like how everything is dark except for the swans and their reflection.  I think this should come in top 10%.</td>', 'This is cool.  Awesome composition.  I like how everything is dark except for the swans and their reflection.  I think this should come in top 10%.', '2009-07-02 20:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5556569, 802814, 103032, '<td valign="top">Without the boat, I think even with the nice reflections, the pic would have been so-so.  I think the white boat is what gives the added punch to the pic.  Good eye, good composition, nice pic.</td>', 'Without the boat, I think even with the nice reflections, the pic would have been so-so.  I think the white boat is what gives the added punch to the pic.  Good eye, good composition, nice pic.', '2009-07-02 20:28:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5556577, 803246, 103032, '<td valign="top">A moody pic.  The only distraction is the white thing on the bottom, a paper cup?  Anyways, its a nice pic.</td>', 'A moody pic.  The only distraction is the white thing on the bottom, a paper cup?  Anyways, its a nice pic.', '2009-07-02 20:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
