(5557261, 802941, 98339, '<td valign="top">ya, know...just when I think there can''t be anymore beautiful flower shots out there....then I open your up...Focus is spot on, colors beautiful and soft, wonderful bokeh...in a nut shell...WOW</td>', 'ya, know...just when I think there can''t be anymore beautiful flower shots out there....then I open your up...Focus is spot on, colors beautiful and soft, wonderful bokeh...in a nut shell...WOW', '2009-07-03 00:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557263, 802702, 98339, '<td valign="top">this is quite beautiful...such soothing blues and whites..must be Greece...I sooo want to go there...excellent processing...job well done</td>', 'this is quite beautiful...such soothing blues and whites..must be Greece...I sooo want to go there...excellent processing...job well done', '2009-07-03 00:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557265, 803281, 98339, '<td valign="top">oh, my...this will be on the front page!!!  stunning and beautiful...love her flowing hair it add just the right movement...wow, wow</td>', 'oh, my...this will be on the front page!!!  stunning and beautiful...love her flowing hair it add just the right movement...wow, wow', '2009-07-03 00:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557268, 802814, 98339, '<td valign="top">I keep wondering were the duds are in this challenge...not here...your reflections and colors are wonderful, what a mystic place!!!  Beautiful</td>', 'I keep wondering were the duds are in this challenge...not here...your reflections and colors are wonderful, what a mystic place!!!  Beautiful', '2009-07-03 00:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557273, 800540, 98339, '<td valign="top">this to me is an Ansel Adams shot...so very rich in tones and detail...stunning</td>', 'this to me is an Ansel Adams shot...so very rich in tones and detail...stunning', '2009-07-03 00:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557635, 803523, 88791, '<td valign="top">Very nice, lighting is spot on.</td>', 'Very nice, lighting is spot on.', '2009-07-03 07:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557674, 801885, 21029, '<td valign="top">A little grainy but overall nice.</td>', 'A little grainy but overall nice.', '2009-07-03 09:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557729, 803019, 79955, '<td valign="top">nice capture. I do like all the negative space in your composition. 6</td>', 'nice capture. I do like all the negative space in your composition. 6', '2009-07-03 12:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557732, 800362, 79955, '<td valign="top">Excellent cloud formations. They really make the shot dramatic and interesting. Maybe a tad too much foreground. Prefer a little more of the dramatic sky. 7</td>', 'Excellent cloud formations. They really make the shot dramatic and interesting. Maybe a tad too much foreground. Prefer a little more of the dramatic sky. 7', '2009-07-03 12:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557734, 800183, 79955, '<td valign="top">Too contrasty for me. 5</td>', 'Too contrasty for me. 5', '2009-07-03 12:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557741, 799251, 65234, '<td valign="top">Love the pose and the catchlight in the eye.  And apparently he eats a fish''s head first =:-O<br/> <br/>Some things I don''t care for in the processing:  oversaturated past realism IMO, and the sky showing through where there should be white on the tail makes him look pasted into the background too much.  Excellent capture, though.</td>', 'Love the pose and the catchlight in the eye.  And apparently he eats a fish''s head first =:-O Some things I don''t care for in the processing:  oversaturated past realism IMO, and the sky showing through where there should be white on the tail makes him look pasted into the background too much.  Excellent capture, though.', '2009-07-03 12:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557746, 801659, 65234, '<td valign="top">Like the movement in the clouds and the shadow on the construction site.  Very poignant space when you know why it''s there; it would just be a nice, detailed city shot otherwise.<br/> <br/>Would do well in the "From Above" challenge if you have the opportunity to go back and re-shoot.</td>', 'Like the movement in the clouds and the shadow on the construction site.  Very poignant space when you know why it''s there; it would just be a nice, detailed city shot otherwise. Would do well in the "From Above" challenge if you have the opportunity to go back and re-shoot.', '2009-07-03 12:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557747, 802403, 65234, '<td valign="top">Awesome job on the exposure to get those sun rays so beautifully :-)  Colors are great; not overdone, and a bit of a dreamy look which the title reinforces.</td>', 'Awesome job on the exposure to get those sun rays so beautifully :-)  Colors are great; not overdone, and a bit of a dreamy look which the title reinforces.', '2009-07-03 12:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557749, 802823, 79955, '<td valign="top">incredible light. lovely contrast. 8</td>', 'incredible light. lovely contrast. 8', '2009-07-03 12:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557751, 803523, 79955, '<td valign="top">very nice still life. 7</td>', 'very nice still life. 7', '2009-07-03 12:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557752, 802814, 65234, '<td valign="top">Pretty, peaceful scene.  Nice composition and rich colors.<br/> <br/>Looks like a bird or something over there on the left in the woods?  Looks different in the reflection ... I might have cloned it out so viewers like me wouldn''t bother trying to figure out what it is ;-)</td>', 'Pretty, peaceful scene.  Nice composition and rich colors. Looks like a bird or something over there on the left in the woods?  Looks different in the reflection ... I might have cloned it out so viewers like me wouldn''t bother trying to figure out what it is ;-)', '2009-07-03 12:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557755, 803121, 79955, '<td valign="top">superb shot , lovely details / color , 8</td>', 'superb shot , lovely details / color , 8', '2009-07-03 12:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557756, 802503, 65234, '<td valign="top">Interesting light on the scene.  I like the gradient in the sky.<br/> <br/>The sun is just a bit overexposed so its rays are not as well defined as I''d like.  Tough exposure to get, I know!  Think I''d try a different crop, too, so the sun wasn''t centered and that line of frost going against the rays on the right was cropped out.  It looks like the horizon isn''t level and the trees are at different angles so it''s hard to tell if this was a hill or a slightly tilted camera angle.</td>', 'Interesting light on the scene.  I like the gradient in the sky. The sun is just a bit overexposed so its rays are not as well defined as I''d like.  Tough exposure to get, I know!  Think I''d try a different crop, too, so the sun wasn''t centered and that line of frost going against the rays on the right was cropped out.  It looks like the horizon isn''t level and the trees are at different angles so it''s hard to tell if this was a hill or a slightly tilted camera angle.', '2009-07-03 12:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557757, 802421, 79955, '<td valign="top">cool pose from a giraffe. would have liked just a  tad more contrast. 6</td>', 'cool pose from a giraffe. would have liked just a  tad more contrast. 6', '2009-07-03 12:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557760, 803470, 65234, '<td valign="top">Love the dreamy mist rising off of the water.  I wonder if a graduated ND filter would have gotten a bit more color in the sky?  Still a lovely image.</td>', 'Love the dreamy mist rising off of the water.  I wonder if a graduated ND filter would have gotten a bit more color in the sky?  Still a lovely image.', '2009-07-03 12:34:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557763, 803488, 79955, '<td valign="top">Lovely!! 9, very special.</td>', 'Lovely!! 9, very special.', '2009-07-03 12:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557767, 802235, 65234, '<td valign="top">I do like the hair swirling in the water.<br/> <br/>Nereids are supposed to be friendly and helpful, which is not something I would guess from this image.  At first I thought she might be preparing to drown herself a la Ophelia.  The pose with the hand holding the arm ... the way its cropped it''s hard to tell if that''s her hand (I think it is) or someone else''s restraining her for some reason.</td>', 'I do like the hair swirling in the water. Nereids are supposed to be friendly and helpful, which is not something I would guess from this image.  At first I thought she might be preparing to drown herself a la Ophelia.  The pose with the hand holding the arm ... the way its cropped it''s hard to tell if that''s her hand (I think it is) or someone else''s restraining her for some reason.', '2009-07-03 12:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557768, 803280, 65234, '<td valign="top">Cool bird!  Could use a bit of a catchlight in the eye to give him some life.</td>', 'Cool bird!  Could use a bit of a catchlight in the eye to give him some life.', '2009-07-03 12:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557775, 798370, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice motion pan.</td>', 'Nice motion pan.', '2009-07-03 12:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557776, 801461, 65234, '<td valign="top">He does an impressive job of filling the frame.  Nice detail.</td>', 'He does an impressive job of filling the frame.  Nice detail.', '2009-07-03 12:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557781, 800846, 65234, '<td valign="top">Tough to catch a bee in flight!  Motion blur in the wings is nice but the rest of him looks like it suffers from too much noise reduction.</td>', 'Tough to catch a bee in flight!  Motion blur in the wings is nice but the rest of him looks like it suffers from too much noise reduction.', '2009-07-03 12:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557785, 803474, 65234, '<td valign="top">No fair using baby kittens!!  The cute factor is off the charts :-)</td>', 'No fair using baby kittens!!  The cute factor is off the charts :-)', '2009-07-03 12:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557787, 797689, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very clean water; I''m used to seeing frogs in much muckier ponds.</td>', 'Very clean water; I''m used to seeing frogs in much muckier ponds.', '2009-07-03 12:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557790, 797701, 65234, '<td valign="top">Wow; it really is!  Lots to explore visually.</td>', 'Wow; it really is!  Lots to explore visually.', '2009-07-03 12:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557792, 803641, 65234, '<td valign="top">Gotta'' love dragonflies :-)  Great detail on his head and legs.</td>', 'Gotta'' love dragonflies :-)  Great detail on his head and legs.', '2009-07-03 12:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557803, 802370, 65234, '<td valign="top">That looks like a storm to avoid!  Great shapes in the clouds and nice job exposing the lightning.  I might play with processing to see if I could make the colors even richer and more dramatic.  Just for fun :-)</td>', 'That looks like a storm to avoid!  Great shapes in the clouds and nice job exposing the lightning.  I might play with processing to see if I could make the colors even richer and more dramatic.  Just for fun :-)', '2009-07-03 12:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557806, 803426, 65234, '<td valign="top">Awwwwwww :-)))</td>', 'Awwwwwww :-)))', '2009-07-03 12:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557810, 799143, 65234, '<td valign="top">Love the reflections in the eyes.  Really tells the story even without the title!</td>', 'Love the reflections in the eyes.  Really tells the story even without the title!', '2009-07-03 12:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557819, 802531, 65234, '<td valign="top">Don''t think I like the light bits all around his edges, even though that''s probably what was there.  Jus doesn''t appeal to me.</td>', 'Don''t think I like the light bits all around his edges, even though that''s probably what was there.  Jus doesn''t appeal to me.', '2009-07-03 13:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557820, 802223, 65234, '<td valign="top">The summery green makes a perfect backdrop for her.  I like that she''s in a fidgety pose, as many toddlers often are :-)</td>', 'The summery green makes a perfect backdrop for her.  I like that she''s in a fidgety pose, as many toddlers often are :-)', '2009-07-03 13:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557822, 803226, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and a stunning subject.</td>', 'Nice composition and a stunning subject.', '2009-07-03 13:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557824, 803168, 65234, '<td valign="top">Apparently in the middle of nowhere.  And dressed like businessmen off to a meeting.  Quite intriguing!</td>', 'Apparently in the middle of nowhere.  And dressed like businessmen off to a meeting.  Quite intriguing!', '2009-07-03 13:05:57.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5557827, 803441, 65234, '<td valign="top">Waddle, waddle, HONK :-)  Nice detail on this fellow (or lady, as the case may be).</td>', 'Waddle, waddle, HONK :-)  Nice detail on this fellow (or lady, as the case may be).', '2009-07-03 13:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557828, 803321, 98339, '<td valign="top">I have skipped this 2/3 times now trying to get my words into a comment...in an odd way this appeals to me...I guess I would call this abstract and it has interesting movement and really good tone...6</td>', 'I have skipped this 2/3 times now trying to get my words into a comment...in an odd way this appeals to me...I guess I would call this abstract and it has interesting movement and really good tone...6', '2009-07-03 13:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557830, 796866, 98339, '<td valign="top">like your band of colors but this just doesn''t wow me...sorry</td>', 'like your band of colors but this just doesn''t wow me...sorry', '2009-07-03 13:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557831, 800458, 65234, '<td valign="top">Great pose; really conveys curiousity.  Could do with a tiny bit of dodging, especially in the shadowed eye.</td>', 'Great pose; really conveys curiousity.  Could do with a tiny bit of dodging, especially in the shadowed eye.', '2009-07-03 13:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557832, 803123, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very colorful and summery.</td>', 'Very colorful and summery.', '2009-07-03 13:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557834, 802417, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lovely beasts; very noble looking.  I like the light and varied poses here.</td>', 'Lovely beasts; very noble looking.  I like the light and varied poses here.', '2009-07-03 13:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557836, 802790, 65234, '<td valign="top">Great composition; nice of them to pose so perfectly for you!</td>', 'Great composition; nice of them to pose so perfectly for you!', '2009-07-03 13:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557839, 802882, 98339, '<td valign="top">I think you used a gradient in this which I usually like...but your scale should have been increased to soften the edges and not make it so very hard...and the opacity dropped...otherwise this is a beautiful picture...bright white and beautiful blues...</td>', 'I think you used a gradient in this which I usually like...but your scale should have been increased to soften the edges and not make it so very hard...and the opacity dropped...otherwise this is a beautiful picture...bright white and beautiful blues...', '2009-07-03 13:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557840, 803537, 98339, '<td valign="top">IMO your blues and greens are pushed to much, to me it has to much of a "shimmer" effect</td>', 'IMO your blues and greens are pushed to much, to me it has to much of a "shimmer" effect', '2009-07-03 13:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557844, 803356, 65234, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous light and color!</td>', 'Gorgeous light and color!', '2009-07-03 13:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557847, 798843, 65234, '<td valign="top">Um ... yuck.  Very detailed yuck, but still, the title says it all ;-)</td>', 'Um ... yuck.  Very detailed yuck, but still, the title says it all ;-)', '2009-07-03 13:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557848, 803257, 65234, '<td valign="top">Love the colors.</td>', 'Love the colors.', '2009-07-03 13:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557850, 803423, 65234, '<td valign="top">Beautifully simple.</td>', 'Beautifully simple.', '2009-07-03 13:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557853, 803114, 65234, '<td valign="top">What a cutie!  Great detail and nice, soft bokeh in the background.  I might crop a little less centered and try to get the eye closer to a rule of thirds positioning for more visual interest.</td>', 'What a cutie!  Great detail and nice, soft bokeh in the background.  I might crop a little less centered and try to get the eye closer to a rule of thirds positioning for more visual interest.', '2009-07-03 13:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557855, 803155, 65234, '<td valign="top">Wonderful sweep of the petals pulling my eye into the flower''s center.  Like the light coming through the petals.  Cute little fly, too, with great detail.</td>', 'Wonderful sweep of the petals pulling my eye into the flower''s center.  Like the light coming through the petals.  Cute little fly, too, with great detail.', '2009-07-03 13:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557857, 800130, 65234, '<td valign="top">A squid!  Nicely detailed and colored.</td>', 'A squid!  Nicely detailed and colored.', '2009-07-03 13:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557858, 801474, 65234, '<td valign="top">Great capture; I''m blown away by the eye contact!</td>', 'Great capture; I''m blown away by the eye contact!', '2009-07-03 13:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557860, 798764, 65234, '<td valign="top">How sweet :-)  Love those big, brown eyes looking at me.</td>', 'How sweet :-)  Love those big, brown eyes looking at me.', '2009-07-03 13:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557861, 799686, 65234, '<td valign="top">Great color and DOF.</td>', 'Great color and DOF.', '2009-07-03 13:32:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557862, 802542, 65234, '<td valign="top">A little March of the Toadstools :-)  I like how they meander through the shot.</td>', 'A little March of the Toadstools :-)  I like how they meander through the shot.', '2009-07-03 13:32:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557865, 802941, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lovely and graceful.</td>', 'Lovely and graceful.', '2009-07-03 13:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557867, 798843, 79955, '<td valign="top">Really wonderful capture , lovely bokeh , 9</td>', 'Really wonderful capture , lovely bokeh , 9', '2009-07-03 13:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557879, 801689, 43774, '<td valign="top">This is fun, good job. Love her eyes.</td>', 'This is fun, good job. Love her eyes.', '2009-07-03 13:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557880, 803235, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very nice detail and composition. I like all the fuzz on the stem and leaves.</td>', 'Very nice detail and composition. I like all the fuzz on the stem and leaves.', '2009-07-03 13:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557883, 798496, 43774, '<td valign="top">I like that there is just one thing on the beach.....it contrasts starkly with the empty ocean and sky. The exposure on the waves is good.</td>', 'I like that there is just one thing on the beach.....it contrasts starkly with the empty ocean and sky. The exposure on the waves is good.', '2009-07-03 13:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557885, 799006, 43774, '<td valign="top">A beautiful softness to this yet it is still sharp and in focus. I like the colours.</td>', 'A beautiful softness to this yet it is still sharp and in focus. I like the colours.', '2009-07-03 13:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557886, 803523, 43774, '<td valign="top">Odd yet good!</td>', 'Odd yet good!', '2009-07-03 13:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557887, 800436, 43774, '<td valign="top">Love the deep rich colours, nice.</td>', 'Love the deep rich colours, nice.', '2009-07-03 13:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557888, 801179, 43774, '<td valign="top">So much to see here, a very interesting photo.</td>', 'So much to see here, a very interesting photo.', '2009-07-03 13:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557890, 801659, 43774, '<td valign="top">I like the clouds, so ominous, fits well with the construction scene and what we all know happened there.</td>', 'I like the clouds, so ominous, fits well with the construction scene and what we all know happened there.', '2009-07-03 13:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557891, 803119, 43774, '<td valign="top">A very good night shot. I like the framing by the trees.</td>', 'A very good night shot. I like the framing by the trees.', '2009-07-03 13:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557893, 802501, 43774, '<td valign="top">My favourite part of this? The tongue.....what detail!</td>', 'My favourite part of this? The tongue.....what detail!', '2009-07-03 13:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557895, 802170, 43774, '<td valign="top">A very nice night shot, reminds me of Old Quebec.</td>', 'A very nice night shot, reminds me of Old Quebec.', '2009-07-03 13:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557896, 803129, 43774, '<td valign="top">I like the light and colours in this.</td>', 'I like the light and colours in this.', '2009-07-03 13:58:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557897, 800540, 43774, '<td valign="top">A wonderful moody shot, good exposure.</td>', 'A wonderful moody shot, good exposure.', '2009-07-03 13:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557898, 803488, 43774, '<td valign="top">A wonderful sky and scene.</td>', 'A wonderful sky and scene.', '2009-07-03 13:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5557900, 800611, 43774, '<td valign="top">Simple and classic, good job.</td>', 'Simple and classic, good job.', '2009-07-03 13:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
