(5558676, 802705, 76335, '<td valign="top">That''s one fast shutter. Great shot.</td>', 'That''s one fast shutter. Great shot.', '2009-07-04 01:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558677, 797692, 76335, '<td valign="top">Beautifully soft.</td>', 'Beautifully soft.', '2009-07-04 01:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558680, 799762, 76335, '<td valign="top">Great low key landscape. I rather like the noise/grain.</td>', 'Great low key landscape. I rather like the noise/grain.', '2009-07-04 01:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558681, 803364, 76335, '<td valign="top">Fabulous!</td>', 'Fabulous!', '2009-07-04 01:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558682, 803463, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed to show off the textures and shapes.</td>', 'Nicely composed to show off the textures and shapes.', '2009-07-04 01:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558683, 798609, 76335, '<td valign="top">Really young...</td>', 'Really young...', '2009-07-04 01:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558684, 803246, 76335, '<td valign="top">I''m sure someone''s going to complain about the garbage in the foreground (a cup?). I rather like it. It feels real.</td>', 'I''m sure someone''s going to complain about the garbage in the foreground (a cup?). I rather like it. It feels real.', '2009-07-04 01:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558689, 803555, 76335, '<td valign="top">Simple and effective. Love the background.</td>', 'Simple and effective. Love the background.', '2009-07-04 01:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558693, 803291, 76335, '<td valign="top">Fabulous angle, point of view. The exposure and colors are a little unnatural, but if you can get past that, it''s an impressive presentation.</td>', 'Fabulous angle, point of view. The exposure and colors are a little unnatural, but if you can get past that, it''s an impressive presentation.', '2009-07-04 01:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558696, 802965, 76335, '<td valign="top">There''s some compositional confusion here for me. Either the tree is just in the way, or I''m missing the message or interest in juxtaposing them against your titular subjects which are out of focus.</td>', 'There''s some compositional confusion here for me. Either the tree is just in the way, or I''m missing the message or interest in juxtaposing them against your titular subjects which are out of focus.', '2009-07-04 02:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558697, 802835, 76335, '<td valign="top">Well done, but this subject has been done to death.</td>', 'Well done, but this subject has been done to death.', '2009-07-04 02:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558699, 803621, 76335, '<td valign="top">Brave of you. I like it.</td>', 'Brave of you. I like it.', '2009-07-04 02:02:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558701, 803353, 76335, '<td valign="top">The lighting is unflattering and the shadow too harsh.</td>', 'The lighting is unflattering and the shadow too harsh.', '2009-07-04 02:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558702, 803623, 76335, '<td valign="top">I <i>want</i> to like this, but I can''t get past the sky. Looks very unnatural like you''ve done too much noise reduction on it perhaps. Nice comp.</td>', 'I want to like this, but I can''t get past the sky. Looks very unnatural like you''ve done too much noise reduction on it perhaps. Nice comp.', '2009-07-04 02:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558704, 802719, 76335, '<td valign="top">Delightfully anthropomorphic.</td>', 'Delightfully anthropomorphic.', '2009-07-04 02:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558708, 801937, 76335, '<td valign="top">Might have had more impact if you had cut off the top half and focused just on the reflection.</td>', 'Might have had more impact if you had cut off the top half and focused just on the reflection.', '2009-07-04 02:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558710, 803205, 76335, '<td valign="top">Wow. Almost looks like a real showroom.</td>', 'Wow. Almost looks like a real showroom.', '2009-07-04 02:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558711, 800325, 76335, '<td valign="top">Are those slats in the chair? Effective background whatever it is.</td>', 'Are those slats in the chair? Effective background whatever it is.', '2009-07-04 02:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558713, 801423, 76335, '<td valign="top">I think capturing him in a more energetic pose would have had more impact.</td>', 'I think capturing him in a more energetic pose would have had more impact.', '2009-07-04 02:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558715, 803446, 76335, '<td valign="top">Great comp but way too sharp.</td>', 'Great comp but way too sharp.', '2009-07-04 02:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558716, 803551, 76335, '<td valign="top">I don''t like that the side of the train is blown out. Almost looks infrared. The comp is great.</td>', 'I don''t like that the side of the train is blown out. Almost looks infrared. The comp is great.', '2009-07-04 02:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558717, 802411, 76335, '<td valign="top">Too much saturation. Looks unnatural. Good wide angle comp though.</td>', 'Too much saturation. Looks unnatural. Good wide angle comp though.', '2009-07-04 02:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558718, 803168, 76335, '<td valign="top">Too cool...</td>', 'Too cool...', '2009-07-04 02:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558719, 801831, 76335, '<td valign="top">An otherwise humdrum subject framed to good and interesting effect.</td>', 'An otherwise humdrum subject framed to good and interesting effect.', '2009-07-04 02:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558722, 801379, 76335, '<td valign="top">The sky is interesting, but the foreground in silhouette takes up a good third of the frame and isn''t anything easily recognizable.</td>', 'The sky is interesting, but the foreground in silhouette takes up a good third of the frame and isn''t anything easily recognizable.', '2009-07-04 02:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558723, 803209, 76335, '<td valign="top">Disorienting and very cool.</td>', 'Disorienting and very cool.', '2009-07-04 02:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558727, 803045, 107943, '<td valign="top">wicked there is totally a face there...</td>', 'wicked there is totally a face there...', '2009-07-04 02:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558728, 801689, 107943, '<td valign="top">Love love love it!!</td>', 'Love love love it!!', '2009-07-04 02:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558780, 802023, 6130, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.</td>', 'Beautiful.', '2009-07-04 04:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558781, 803488, 99448, '<td valign="top">wow, this has to win, it''s amazing, the sky is just great, the ice is amazing, sorry for say amazing so many times, well you carn''t blame me, lol, <u><b>10</b></u> and it''s made my <u><b>favorites</b></u></td>', 'wow, this has to win, it''s amazing, the sky is just great, the ice is amazing, sorry for say amazing so many times, well you carn''t blame me, lol, 10 and it''s made my favorites', '2009-07-04 04:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558798, 802023, 86628, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous, I just wish her head wasn''t aligned with the black blob of trees (?) in the background.</td>', 'Gorgeous, I just wish her head wasn''t aligned with the black blob of trees (?) in the background.', '2009-07-04 06:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558800, 798501, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting image, I like the effect of the background trees and the sun trying to reach through the fog. I''m not so keen on the foreground tree though, I don''t think it works quite right.<br/> <br/>I know without the foreground tree the shot might be a little bland, but there''s something about the composition of it that isn''t agreeing with me. 6.</td>', 'This is an interesting image, I like the effect of the background trees and the sun trying to reach through the fog. I''m not so keen on the foreground tree though, I don''t think it works quite right. I know without the foreground tree the shot might be a little bland, but there''s something about the composition of it that isn''t agreeing with me. 6.', '2009-07-04 06:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558801, 800068, 101117, '<td valign="top">Great action shot, great timing and good composition. It''s a shame we''re looking at him from behind though, would be better if he was facing the camera. 7.</td>', 'Great action shot, great timing and good composition. It''s a shame we''re looking at him from behind though, would be better if he was facing the camera. 7.', '2009-07-04 06:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558802, 797220, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is a really interesting and entertaining use of a fisheye lens! This to me is exactly the kind of thing they should be used for!<br/> <br/>Love the fact you''ve included people and traffic along the bottom as well, it really works well. I also really like the fact that you''ve kept the sun flare, it works well. <br/> <br/>This image should be hung in the lobby of the building of which I''m assuming the big circle thing belongs to, you should see if they will buy it! 8.</td>', 'This is a really interesting and entertaining use of a fisheye lens! This to me is exactly the kind of thing they should be used for! Love the fact you''ve included people and traffic along the bottom as well, it really works well. I also really like the fact that you''ve kept the sun flare, it works well.  This image should be hung in the lobby of the building of which I''m assuming the big circle thing belongs to, you should see if they will buy it! 8.', '2009-07-04 06:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558803, 803260, 101117, '<td valign="top">I was wondering what the deal was with the egg on the checkerboard background, then I saw the name and figured it wasn''t meant to mean anything in particular.<br/> <br/>It has some interesting lighting on the egg, not sure about the angle / orientation of the checkerboard.<br/> <br/>Overall it''s not an image that particularly appeals to me, but that''s more personal preference than there being anything wrong with it. 6.</td>', 'I was wondering what the deal was with the egg on the checkerboard background, then I saw the name and figured it wasn''t meant to mean anything in particular. It has some interesting lighting on the egg, not sure about the angle / orientation of the checkerboard. Overall it''s not an image that particularly appeals to me, but that''s more personal preference than there being anything wrong with it. 6.', '2009-07-04 06:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558805, 803040, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is a great series of reflections, it almost becomes some sort of abstract geometry art thing.<br/> <br/>Don''t like the colours particularly, I think if you had a blue sky in the first place I would have liked to see it all with a blue tint rather than the green tint you''ve done.</td>', 'This is a great series of reflections, it almost becomes some sort of abstract geometry art thing. Don''t like the colours particularly, I think if you had a blue sky in the first place I would have liked to see it all with a blue tint rather than the green tint you''ve done.', '2009-07-04 06:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558806, 803586, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is the sort of thing that will probably only appeal to a select group of people. Not being a bike fan I don''t really know what I''m looking at, I understand it''s a bike, but all I really see is a load of shiny metal.<br/> <br/>The reflection is a nice idea, but what annoys me is that the text is ruined by the reflection, and then conversely the reflection is ruined by the text.</td>', 'This is the sort of thing that will probably only appeal to a select group of people. Not being a bike fan I don''t really know what I''m looking at, I understand it''s a bike, but all I really see is a load of shiny metal. The reflection is a nice idea, but what annoys me is that the text is ruined by the reflection, and then conversely the reflection is ruined by the text.', '2009-07-04 06:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558809, 802526, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice enough high key image, but it doesn''t instantly appeal to me. It should be a peaceful image, but I think the colours and tone you have given it add some tension which isn''t suited to the scene itself.</td>', 'Nice enough high key image, but it doesn''t instantly appeal to me. It should be a peaceful image, but I think the colours and tone you have given it add some tension which isn''t suited to the scene itself.', '2009-07-04 07:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558813, 802987, 101117, '<td valign="top">If you hadn''t explained what this was I might have had a hard time figuring it out. It''s an interesting series of disjointed objects, and I''ve seen things like this work, though in this case I''m not so sure it does.<br/> <br/>I think the lighting is too "normal" if you see what I mean. Rather than being some sort of surreal / weird / abstract scene, the lighting / composition has just left it being a bunch of unrelated objects.</td>', 'If you hadn''t explained what this was I might have had a hard time figuring it out. It''s an interesting series of disjointed objects, and I''ve seen things like this work, though in this case I''m not so sure it does. I think the lighting is too "normal" if you see what I mean. Rather than being some sort of surreal / weird / abstract scene, the lighting / composition has just left it being a bunch of unrelated objects.', '2009-07-04 07:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558818, 803457, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is a really curious abstract image. I''ve been sitting looking at it for a while trying to figure out exactly what it is and I''m none the wiser.<br/> <br/>It''s an interesting image, not one that appeals to me particularly, it''s a touch to abstract for my tastes, but I like move away from the norm and interesting contrast you have between the strong earth colours (which I suspect is what it actually is) and then the almost monochrome smoke like strip across the middle. 6 from me.</td>', 'This is a really curious abstract image. I''ve been sitting looking at it for a while trying to figure out exactly what it is and I''m none the wiser. It''s an interesting image, not one that appeals to me particularly, it''s a touch to abstract for my tastes, but I like move away from the norm and interesting contrast you have between the strong earth colours (which I suspect is what it actually is) and then the almost monochrome smoke like strip across the middle. 6 from me.', '2009-07-04 07:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558821, 803641, 101117, '<td valign="top">Cool bug macro, with great detail and good focus.<br/> <br/>I''ve had a couple of go''s at capturing these guys and I can never quite get close enough to get something like this.</td>', 'Cool bug macro, with great detail and good focus. I''ve had a couple of go''s at capturing these guys and I can never quite get close enough to get something like this.', '2009-07-04 07:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558823, 802961, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice image. I like the way the two figures are silhouetted against the orange sky, while the net actually has some detail.</td>', 'Nice image. I like the way the two figures are silhouetted against the orange sky, while the net actually has some detail.', '2009-07-04 07:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558842, 802560, 53147, '<td valign="top">The image titled "Shaman Ritual" came up immediately before this image. My wife and I had a good laugh over it.</td>', 'The image titled "Shaman Ritual" came up immediately before this image. My wife and I had a good laugh over it.', '2009-07-04 08:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558859, 803613, 98339, '<td valign="top">love the tones and colors in this..so very dark and moody, yet you can see all the detail...well done</td>', 'love the tones and colors in this..so very dark and moody, yet you can see all the detail...well done', '2009-07-04 09:49:23.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5558860, 801038, 98339, '<td valign="top">really like your tones...they are well done, and I like how she is facing away from the camera.</td>', 'really like your tones...they are well done, and I like how she is facing away from the camera.', '2009-07-04 09:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558861, 803626, 98339, '<td valign="top">if this were a challenge for zoo or animals then maybe...but in a FS this is going to have a hard time..your focus is spot on and I really like the background</td>', 'if this were a challenge for zoo or animals then maybe...but in a FS this is going to have a hard time..your focus is spot on and I really like the background', '2009-07-04 09:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558862, 802560, 98339, '<td valign="top">this is to cute!!  like your DOF and your colors are excellent</td>', 'this is to cute!!  like your DOF and your colors are excellent', '2009-07-04 09:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558864, 800536, 98339, '<td valign="top">such pretty colors in the sunset, but IMO the beach line does not add to the shot, to busy and cluttered (it almost looks like a bunch of trash scattered, even though I know it isn''t)</td>', 'such pretty colors in the sunset, but IMO the beach line does not add to the shot, to busy and cluttered (it almost looks like a bunch of trash scattered, even though I know it isn''t)', '2009-07-04 09:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558865, 802334, 98339, '<td valign="top">rough and tumble???  Kittens are so precious...until they bear their claws and I think there might be some of that going on here!!!  excellent colors and focus, I like your composition</td>', 'rough and tumble???  Kittens are so precious...until they bear their claws and I think there might be some of that going on here!!!  excellent colors and focus, I like your composition', '2009-07-04 09:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558867, 802117, 98339, '<td valign="top">so very pretty, excellent colors and reflections and no light "blurring" very good</td>', 'so very pretty, excellent colors and reflections and no light "blurring" very good', '2009-07-04 09:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558869, 802197, 98339, '<td valign="top">ya, know it takes me a minute to get to the zebra that is in focus, my eye is drawn to the 2nd one...kind of cool in an artsie fartsie way...</td>', 'ya, know it takes me a minute to get to the zebra that is in focus, my eye is drawn to the 2nd one...kind of cool in an artsie fartsie way...', '2009-07-04 09:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558871, 803463, 98339, '<td valign="top">excellent colors and focus, your processing is spot on...well done</td>', 'excellent colors and focus, your processing is spot on...well done', '2009-07-04 09:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558873, 803428, 98339, '<td valign="top">We thought ya was a toad, a Horny Toad!!! (oh, brother where are thou) great movie...I personally haven''t ever seen one of these...excellent focus and tones...</td>', 'We thought ya was a toad, a Horny Toad!!! (oh, brother where are thou) great movie...I personally haven''t ever seen one of these...excellent focus and tones...', '2009-07-04 10:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558881, 803054, 98339, '<td valign="top">you have excellent focus and processing, but in "this" FS, this is a hard one...</td>', 'you have excellent focus and processing, but in "this" FS, this is a hard one...', '2009-07-04 10:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558883, 798755, 98339, '<td valign="top">this almost looks like and overlay...I really like the "grungy" look that it has...and how the sun just radiates from it''s core...</td>', 'this almost looks like and overlay...I really like the "grungy" look that it has...and how the sun just radiates from it''s core...', '2009-07-04 10:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558884, 803368, 98339, '<td valign="top">great candid shot...excellent focus and processing...it just doesn''t wow me sorry</td>', 'great candid shot...excellent focus and processing...it just doesn''t wow me sorry', '2009-07-04 10:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558885, 802014, 101117, '<td valign="top">Great unusual wedding(?) shot. I don''t know how well the B&amp;W conversion works, it feels a touch high contrast to me, but it''s hard to say without seeing the original.</td>', 'Great unusual wedding(?) shot. I don''t know how well the B&W conversion works, it feels a touch high contrast to me, but it''s hard to say without seeing the original.', '2009-07-04 10:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558887, 803184, 98339, '<td valign="top">that is an excellent shot...great tones and excellent focus...(not an easy thing on a moving bird as I have found out)</td>', 'that is an excellent shot...great tones and excellent focus...(not an easy thing on a moving bird as I have found out)', '2009-07-04 10:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558888, 803587, 98339, '<td valign="top">man oh man is that ever pretty, so very calming and pleasant</td>', 'man oh man is that ever pretty, so very calming and pleasant', '2009-07-04 10:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558889, 801093, 101117, '<td valign="top">Kinda looks like he''s saying "come here, I''ve got something to show you".<br/> <br/>Great colours, they''re so vivid it almost looks computer generated. I''m guessing this was some sort of exhibition at a museum or something.</td>', 'Kinda looks like he''s saying "come here, I''ve got something to show you". Great colours, they''re so vivid it almost looks computer generated. I''m guessing this was some sort of exhibition at a museum or something.', '2009-07-04 10:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558890, 803611, 98339, '<td valign="top">I like the angle that you took this at....and I like the tones in it as well, nice and rich...excellent detail</td>', 'I like the angle that you took this at....and I like the tones in it as well, nice and rich...excellent detail', '2009-07-04 10:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558892, 799677, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice street scene, perfectly captures the typical British / Irish (in this case) pub.<br/> <br/>The shot, while not being particularly outstanding does have good colours and is well composed.</td>', 'Nice street scene, perfectly captures the typical British / Irish (in this case) pub. The shot, while not being particularly outstanding does have good colours and is well composed.', '2009-07-04 10:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558893, 803426, 98339, '<td valign="top">to me this seems a bit underexposed...you have excellent focus and good color (although a bit dark)</td>', 'to me this seems a bit underexposed...you have excellent focus and good color (although a bit dark)', '2009-07-04 10:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558894, 803140, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice dream like shot. The whole thing feels slightly surreal.<br/> <br/>You have a very good combination of lens use (lensbaby?) and post processing here. I''m not normally a fan of lensbaby style shots at all, but you''ve put it to good use!</td>', 'This is a really nice dream like shot. The whole thing feels slightly surreal. You have a very good combination of lens use (lensbaby?) and post processing here. I''m not normally a fan of lensbaby style shots at all, but you''ve put it to good use!', '2009-07-04 10:19:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558895, 802527, 98339, '<td valign="top">this would really do good in the Street Challenge....really good</td>', 'this would really do good in the Street Challenge....really good', '2009-07-04 10:19:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558896, 801476, 98339, '<td valign="top">just a little blurry...but then they are going very fast aren''t they...</td>', 'just a little blurry...but then they are going very fast aren''t they...', '2009-07-04 10:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558897, 802542, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice colourful shot. Good use of shallow DOF and great angle to get them from.<br/> <br/>There is something about this shot that gives it an almost fake feel, I think it might be the highly saturated colours. It''s not necessarily a bad thing here, it gives the shot a sort of Fairytale look to it.</td>', 'Nice colourful shot. Good use of shallow DOF and great angle to get them from. There is something about this shot that gives it an almost fake feel, I think it might be the highly saturated colours. It''s not necessarily a bad thing here, it gives the shot a sort of Fairytale look to it.', '2009-07-04 10:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558899, 800931, 98339, '<td valign="top">such a sweet car,if this is the same car as the one in Old Cars, I really like the angle of this one better...you''ve done more advanced editing on this but I still like the angle of this a whole lot better...</td>', 'such a sweet car,if this is the same car as the one in Old Cars, I really like the angle of this one better...you''ve done more advanced editing on this but I still like the angle of this a whole lot better...', '2009-07-04 10:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558900, 802223, 98339, '<td valign="top">oh, now this is one to hang on your wall, such a precious child...excellent processing</td>', 'oh, now this is one to hang on your wall, such a precious child...excellent processing', '2009-07-04 10:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558901, 799600, 98339, '<td valign="top">love how the feathers are fluffed and rippled...excellent detail and processing...wonderful colors</td>', 'love how the feathers are fluffed and rippled...excellent detail and processing...wonderful colors', '2009-07-04 10:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558902, 803513, 101117, '<td valign="top">Very good early morning / calm mood to it. I like the composition and I think the exposure is just right, however I''m pretty certain you have partially desaturated it, which I almost always take an instant dislike to, and this particular shot is no exception.<br/> <br/>For me if you had maintained even a little colour in the background building, trees and perhaps the water, I would have liked it a whole lot more.</td>', 'Very good early morning / calm mood to it. I like the composition and I think the exposure is just right, however I''m pretty certain you have partially desaturated it, which I almost always take an instant dislike to, and this particular shot is no exception. For me if you had maintained even a little colour in the background building, trees and perhaps the water, I would have liked it a whole lot more.', '2009-07-04 10:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558904, 803425, 101117, '<td valign="top">This really just looks like a snapshot of some friends. Compositionaly you have cut the girl on the right off slightly, the shot is leaning to the right and you have lens flare which isn''t adding to the shot at all.</td>', 'This really just looks like a snapshot of some friends. Compositionaly you have cut the girl on the right off slightly, the shot is leaning to the right and you have lens flare which isn''t adding to the shot at all.', '2009-07-04 10:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558905, 803019, 101117, '<td valign="top">Always good fun to catch these, and keeping the camera dry at the same time if you''re not in some sort of shelter is tricky!<br/> <br/>This scene looks quite isolated, which is nice, and I like the amount of black space you have left.</td>', 'Always good fun to catch these, and keeping the camera dry at the same time if you''re not in some sort of shelter is tricky! This scene looks quite isolated, which is nice, and I like the amount of black space you have left.', '2009-07-04 10:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558907, 802698, 101117, '<td valign="top">Great well coloured landscape shot, everything here works nicely. This is the sort of thing I can quite easily picture on a postcard from some remote place I''ve never heard of.</td>', 'Great well coloured landscape shot, everything here works nicely. This is the sort of thing I can quite easily picture on a postcard from some remote place I''ve never heard of.', '2009-07-04 10:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558908, 803370, 101117, '<td valign="top">Great capture, I like the way the sun has created strong outlines across the top of the cloud as well as the rays of light. This contrasts nicely with the dark almost silhouette landscape.</td>', 'Great capture, I like the way the sun has created strong outlines across the top of the cloud as well as the rays of light. This contrasts nicely with the dark almost silhouette landscape.', '2009-07-04 10:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558929, 795726, 76335, '<td valign="top">Good POV and background, but the lens flare across her face is unappealing.</td>', 'Good POV and background, but the lens flare across her face is unappealing.', '2009-07-04 11:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558930, 802863, 76335, '<td valign="top">Good character study. I like the tones/processing.</td>', 'Good character study. I like the tones/processing.', '2009-07-04 11:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558931, 798764, 76335, '<td valign="top">Great nature shot, nicely framed. I like the Debussian title.</td>', 'Great nature shot, nicely framed. I like the Debussian title.', '2009-07-04 11:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558932, 803422, 76335, '<td valign="top">Surreal. Nicely done!</td>', 'Surreal. Nicely done!', '2009-07-04 11:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5558934, 801853, 76335, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of some of the work of <a href="//www.bluejake.com/archives.php" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Jake Dobkin</a>. I''ll be curious to read how (or if) you got access. Clearly its condemned -- or just abandoned.</td>', 'Reminds me of some of the work of Jake Dobkin. I''ll be curious to read how (or if) you got access. Clearly its condemned -- or just abandoned.', '2009-07-04 11:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
