(5558978, 803235, 68956, '<td valign="top">Looks like Pulsatilla to me ;) Nice to see a different viewpoint in a flower portrait</td>', 'Looks like Pulsatilla to me ;) Nice to see a different viewpoint in a flower portrait', '2009-07-04 11:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5559028, 801421, 83313, '<td valign="top">Interesting building, but the composition and perspective just seem kind of plain to me. Perhaps cropped a little to tight as well, for my taste. Exposure and sharpness are spot-on.</td>', 'Interesting building, but the composition and perspective just seem kind of plain to me. Perhaps cropped a little to tight as well, for my taste. Exposure and sharpness are spot-on.', '2009-07-04 13:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5559030, 801477, 83313, '<td valign="top">Wonderful play of light. This has the look of a <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=30982" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Melethia</a> shot. If it is not, please take that as a compliment.</td>', 'Wonderful play of light. This has the look of a  Melethia shot. If it is not, please take that as a compliment.', '2009-07-04 13:02:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5559034, 803546, 83313, '<td valign="top">Glad you chose to enter this one. It''s a real keeper and totally adorable. (No vote, comment only)</td>', 'Glad you chose to enter this one. It''s a real keeper and totally adorable. (No vote, comment only)', '2009-07-04 13:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5559044, 802943, 83313, '<td valign="top">Neat patterns and colors on that mound of grain, but I think the composition of the shot  could be improved. There is way too much sky that it not doing anything for the shot, and all the interesting stuff  is packed in at the bottom. I think a different perspective on this would be quite good.</td>', 'Neat patterns and colors on that mound of grain, but I think the composition of the shot  could be improved. There is way too much sky that it not doing anything for the shot, and all the interesting stuff  is packed in at the bottom. I think a different perspective on this would be quite good.', '2009-07-04 13:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5559046, 802719, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice, I really like the colors and tones here. It''s cropped perhaps a little tight for my own preferences.</td>', 'Nice, I really like the colors and tones here. It''s cropped perhaps a little tight for my own preferences.', '2009-07-04 13:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5559050, 803487, 83313, '<td valign="top">Starting to lose count of how many times I have seen this! It''s a great subject, though. My employer handed out a calendar this year that included a shot of this, I could not believe how oversharpened with visible sharpening halos their calendar shot was.</td>', 'Starting to lose count of how many times I have seen this! It''s a great subject, though. My employer handed out a calendar this year that included a shot of this, I could not believe how oversharpened with visible sharpening halos their calendar shot was.', '2009-07-04 13:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5559053, 803457, 83313, '<td valign="top">Looks like you were rotating the camera during a long exposure? Very cool looking.</td>', 'Looks like you were rotating the camera during a long exposure? Very cool looking.', '2009-07-04 13:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5559056, 803332, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid your processing to make the people stand out gives it a fake look. The edges are harsh and it looks like they were ''shopped in, rather than being part of the scene.</td>', 'I''m afraid your processing to make the people stand out gives it a fake look. The edges are harsh and it looks like they were ''shopped in, rather than being part of the scene.', '2009-07-04 13:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5559058, 803419, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice high-key treatment of this. I''m curious how wide a focal length you had to use to fit this all in.</td>', 'Nice high-key treatment of this. I''m curious how wide a focal length you had to use to fit this all in.', '2009-07-04 13:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5559059, 803618, 83313, '<td valign="top">An interesting take on minimalism, but it''s just not impacting me much. Not quite sure what to suggest or how to explain it, though.</td>', 'An interesting take on minimalism, but it''s just not impacting me much. Not quite sure what to suggest or how to explain it, though.', '2009-07-04 13:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5559060, 797689, 83313, '<td valign="top">Has some really good potential, but I think the shot comes off a little flat. A few more adjustments (levels, curves, contrast) might really make this stand out.</td>', 'Has some really good potential, but I think the shot comes off a little flat. A few more adjustments (levels, curves, contrast) might really make this stand out.', '2009-07-04 13:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5559066, 802179, 83313, '<td valign="top">I think there are a few issues with this that will keep it pretty low in this challenge. <br/> <br/>-Composition is too centered. The ducks are plopped right in the middle of the frame and my eye is not led anywhere.<br/>-White balance may be off some, and could account for so much brownish tone, which is keeping the subject from standing out. Something is off with the colors.<br/>-The detail on the ducks seems a little soft. I suspect this may have been an extreme crop.<br/>-Ducks are just a difficult subject to do because they are so common. A duck shot must be really outstanding to get attention.<br/> <br/>Sorry to be so harsh on your effort, but I hope this was at least useful.</td>', 'I think there are a few issues with this that will keep it pretty low in this challenge.  -Composition is too centered. The ducks are plopped right in the middle of the frame and my eye is not led anywhere.-White balance may be off some, and could account for so much brownish tone, which is keeping the subject from standing out. Something is off with the colors.-The detail on the ducks seems a little soft. I suspect this may have been an extreme crop.-Ducks are just a difficult subject to do because they are so common. A duck shot must be really outstanding to get attention. Sorry to be so harsh on your effort, but I hope this was at least useful.', '2009-07-04 13:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5559072, 802562, 83313, '<td valign="top">Wow! Lovely and nicely done. I hope to be able to do photos of people this well someday. I may not do a lot of gorgeous half naked models in rivers, however.</td>', 'Wow! Lovely and nicely done. I hope to be able to do photos of people this well someday. I may not do a lot of gorgeous half naked models in rivers, however.', '2009-07-04 13:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5559081, 803005, 83313, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a touch to centered for my preference, but otherwise, a nice pleasing portrait.</td>', 'Perhaps a touch to centered for my preference, but otherwise, a nice pleasing portrait.', '2009-07-04 13:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
