(5559279, 803542, 44877, '<td valign="top">Disclaimer for leaving less-than-positive feedback: In the spirit of leaving comments on photos that I''m voting 5 and below - I find the subject holds little interest (and that might be a taste thing). Technically, too little of the leaf is in focus and the light is a bit harsh around the edges. The super black background is great.</td>', 'Disclaimer for leaving less-than-positive feedback: In the spirit of leaving comments on photos that I''m voting 5 and below - I find the subject holds little interest (and that might be a taste thing). Technically, too little of the leaf is in focus and the light is a bit harsh around the edges. The super black background is great.', '2009-07-04 17:45:32.000000', NULL, 1),
