(5559488, 803313, 41337, '<td valign="top">This image has a feel to it, similar in a way to Hitchcock. The technicals are good but they don''t take center stage like in some other photos. This is good.</td>', 'This image has a feel to it, similar in a way to Hitchcock. The technicals are good but they don''t take center stage like in some other photos. This is good.', '2009-07-04 20:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5559492, 803434, 41337, '<td valign="top">Great technicals however, it lacks feel, IMO. By that I mean it feels less like a portrait and more like a model shoot taken Rembrandt style.</td>', 'Great technicals however, it lacks feel, IMO. By that I mean it feels less like a portrait and more like a model shoot taken Rembrandt style.', '2009-07-04 20:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5559494, 803263, 41337, '<td valign="top">Very slick presentation. You know what you did right so I''ll just focus on a couple minor issues that jump out at me. First, the light on his left hand, (i.e. the streak). That should have been spotted and fixed. Also that same hand would look better had it been relaxed rather than clenched especially given the location of the hand. :) Also, if it was relaxed you could have shown a nice big ring that could have served as a double entendre.  Other than that the technicals are flawless, a very professional image.</td>', 'Very slick presentation. You know what you did right so I''ll just focus on a couple minor issues that jump out at me. First, the light on his left hand, (i.e. the streak). That should have been spotted and fixed. Also that same hand would look better had it been relaxed rather than clenched especially given the location of the hand. :) Also, if it was relaxed you could have shown a nice big ring that could have served as a double entendre.  Other than that the technicals are flawless, a very professional image.', '2009-07-04 20:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5559531, 803473, 24486, '<td valign="top">Lovely colour tones in this one.</td>', 'Lovely colour tones in this one.', '2009-07-04 21:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
