(5559631, 801659, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice HDR image, this would have worked well in the construction challenge as well!<br/> <br/>I like the depth you have captured here, gives a great sense of scale.</td>', 'Nice HDR image, this would have worked well in the construction challenge as well! I like the depth you have captured here, gives a great sense of scale.', '2009-07-04 23:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
