(5560032, 803353, 34938, '<td valign="top">I like it overall, but it has way more potential that you got out of it. The composition, negative space and shadow really work, but the light is flat and drab. Some post processing working with levels and curves would have made this really pop. as it is, it''s a snap of a pretty girl in front of a bland wall 5</td>', 'I like it overall, but it has way more potential that you got out of it. The composition, negative space and shadow really work, but the light is flat and drab. Some post processing working with levels and curves would have made this really pop. as it is, it''s a snap of a pretty girl in front of a bland wall 5', '2009-07-05 09:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
