(5560809, 803605, 76335, '<td valign="top">Seems to be leaning to the right. I might have cut out some of the sky, since you seem to be showing us the boats. (The sky is already nicely reflected in the water anyway.)</td>', 'Seems to be leaning to the right. I might have cut out some of the sky, since you seem to be showing us the boats. (The sky is already nicely reflected in the water anyway.)', '2009-07-05 20:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
