(5560902, 803638, 76335, '<td valign="top">Yes, yes, yes! Points for the title alone. This is one of those shots where you feel rewarded by low scores and bemused comments. Not from me though. I love it!</td>', 'Yes, yes, yes! Points for the title alone. This is one of those shots where you feel rewarded by low scores and bemused comments. Not from me though. I love it!', '2009-07-05 22:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
