(5561527, 803263, 5728, '<td valign="top">Cool pic, nice set up. I am not a fan of all this hdr filter stuff though, especially not on people.</td>', 'Cool pic, nice set up. I am not a fan of all this hdr filter stuff though, especially not on people.', '2009-07-06 06:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
