(5563526, 801477, 50695, '<td valign="top">I''m having a raging argument with myself over this picture. My left brain says I''ve seen it before. But my eyes say, no, I have never seen this picture before. In fact, I''m hardly seeing it now. I think it''s because there''s glass where I don''t expect there to be glass, and reflections where I don''t expect there to be reflections. This is where my heart steps in and settles the matter. He is a fool for you. Maybe it''s the way the processing of the photo goes with the processing of the rain. Maybe it''s the creamy shadows. The photo simply has the heart and authority to demand a blue ribbon, so I give it mine.<br/> <br/>Posthumous Blue Ribbon <img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg"/></td>', 'I''m having a raging argument with myself over this picture. My left brain says I''ve seen it before. But my eyes say, no, I have never seen this picture before. In fact, I''m hardly seeing it now. I think it''s because there''s glass where I don''t expect there to be glass, and reflections where I don''t expect there to be reflections. This is where my heart steps in and settles the matter. He is a fool for you. Maybe it''s the way the processing of the photo goes with the processing of the rain. Maybe it''s the creamy shadows. The photo simply has the heart and authority to demand a blue ribbon, so I give it mine. Posthumous Blue Ribbon ', '2009-07-07 22:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
