(5564631, 803621, 66515, '<td valign="top">I applaud you for experimenting. Naturally this is abstract given the technique you used but this just doesn''t grab me though. In any event, the technique is worth exploring further I think. It just needs the right scene to make it work effectively.<br/> <br/>That aside I was wondering if this was converted to black and white. If so I am curious what this would look like in color.</td>', 'I applaud you for experimenting. Naturally this is abstract given the technique you used but this just doesn''t grab me though. In any event, the technique is worth exploring further I think. It just needs the right scene to make it work effectively. That aside I was wondering if this was converted to black and white. If so I am curious what this would look like in color.', '2009-07-08 05:08:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(5564632, 803488, 94949, '<td valign="top">Glæsilegt hjá þér félagi, þetta hefur verið góð ferð hjá ykkur.  Til hamingju með þetta.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-07-08 04:16:29.</i></td>', 'Glæsilegt hjá þér félagi, þetta hefur verið góð ferð hjá ykkur.  Til hamingju með þetta.', '2009-07-08 05:16:11.000000', '2009-07-08 05:16:29.000000', 0),
(5564635, 802417, 18450, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot!!! Congrats on your well deserved top place.</td>', 'Beautiful shot!!! Congrats on your well deserved top place.', '2009-07-08 05:26:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(5564642, 797701, 94949, '<td valign="top">Thanks AP<br/> <br/>This is taken on the Reykjanes Peninsula in Iceland.  Of course all post processing involves a bit of Saturation but I can honestly tell you that all of the colors in the picture are there.  It´s an amazing place.<br/> <br/>The name of it is SOG.  If you do a google image search with these keywords "sog keilir" you should get more info.<br/> <br/>Thanks all!!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Thanks AP This is taken on the Reykjanes Peninsula in Iceland.  Of course all post processing involves a bit of Saturation but I can honestly tell you that all of the colors in the picture are there.  It´s an amazing place. The name of it is SOG.  If you do a google image search with these keywords "sog keilir" you should get more info. Thanks all!! ', '2009-07-08 05:32:01.000000', NULL, 0),
