(5564680, 803291, 45475, '<td valign="top">Now those long blue bars in the vote breakdown sure are purdy :) Excellent work with angle and composition. Just expanding on AP''s thoughts a little... might be the architect''s job to design and build his vision, but it takes a skillful photographer to translate that vision through a photograph. You''ve done that.</td>', 'Now those long blue bars in the vote breakdown sure are purdy :) Excellent work with angle and composition. Just expanding on AP''s thoughts a little... might be the architect''s job to design and build his vision, but it takes a skillful photographer to translate that vision through a photograph. You''ve done that.', '2009-07-08 06:53:59.000000', NULL, 0),
