(5564751, 803214, 36981, '<td valign="top">Wow - this was one of my favorites from the challenge &amp; I''m shocked that at its placement.  It''s original, has a compelling composition &amp; its oddly moving for me.  I''m sorry so few others see it the same way.</td>', 'Wow - this was one of my favorites from the challenge & I''m shocked that at its placement.  It''s original, has a compelling composition & its oddly moving for me.  I''m sorry so few others see it the same way.', '2009-07-08 08:04:17.000000', NULL, 0),
