(5564932, 802602, 30049, '<td valign="top">I had to come back and see what the story might be on this one.  I had picked this as a top ten (or twenty at least) and gave you a 10.  Surprised (shouldn''t be I guess) that it came in at 70th.<br/> <br/>When I first looked at this image I was a bit shocked to see an attractive woman in an obviously real (or way over the top staged) war (or training) scenario.  Second, I wondered why this soldier wasn''t wearing a helmet.  The lack of a helmet put a slight tinge of feeling this could be staged.  Then I looked deeper into the photo and noticed the military shelters in the background.  I was then convinced this was the real deal.<br/> <br/>After having to spend so much time wondering, questioning, admiring...I had to give it a 10 for making me stop for such a long consideration!  <br/> <br/>Congrats on a well done photo, and good luck with your book!</td>', 'I had to come back and see what the story might be on this one.  I had picked this as a top ten (or twenty at least) and gave you a 10.  Surprised (shouldn''t be I guess) that it came in at 70th. When I first looked at this image I was a bit shocked to see an attractive woman in an obviously real (or way over the top staged) war (or training) scenario.  Second, I wondered why this soldier wasn''t wearing a helmet.  The lack of a helmet put a slight tinge of feeling this could be staged.  Then I looked deeper into the photo and noticed the military shelters in the background.  I was then convinced this was the real deal. After having to spend so much time wondering, questioning, admiring...I had to give it a 10 for making me stop for such a long consideration!   Congrats on a well done photo, and good luck with your book!', '2009-07-08 10:17:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(5564939, 803140, 30049, '<td valign="top">I really enjoyed this image when I came across it during voting.  Great use of LB to solidify the storyline you so wonderfully captured!  I was one of your seven 10''s.  Wish it had placed higher but I''m not surprised (duotone, grainy, blur, etc...) - it places high on the "artsy" scale.  :-)</td>', 'I really enjoyed this image when I came across it during voting.  Great use of LB to solidify the storyline you so wonderfully captured!  I was one of your seven 10''s.  Wish it had placed higher but I''m not surprised (duotone, grainy, blur, etc...) - it places high on the "artsy" scale.  :-)', '2009-07-08 10:23:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(5564945, 802023, 100335, '<td valign="top">Love this! Color tones are great. Added to faves.</td>', 'Love this! Color tones are great. Added to faves.', '2009-07-08 10:26:08.000000', NULL, 0),
