(5566081, 803487, 83080, '<td valign="top">Wow Ken!  I love seeing your lighthouse pictures.  This one has amazing colors and the HDR is very tastefully done.  Thanks!</td>', 'Wow Ken!  I love seeing your lighthouse pictures.  This one has amazing colors and the HDR is very tastefully done.  Thanks!', '2009-07-08 21:34:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(5566101, 803593, 81530, '<td valign="top">I thought it was a good photo. I gave it a 7. The flag complements the people, and the bubbles are an extra bonus. I have to agree about the square crop; another shape would suit this photo better. I might have cropped the top left window out as it is fighting for attention, but then again, you would lose some of those bubbles.</td>', 'I thought it was a good photo. I gave it a 7. The flag complements the people, and the bubbles are an extra bonus. I have to agree about the square crop; another shape would suit this photo better. I might have cropped the top left window out as it is fighting for attention, but then again, you would lose some of those bubbles.', '2009-07-08 21:52:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(5566105, 803593, 49773, '<td valign="top">I like everything about this photograph!</td>', 'I like everything about this photograph!', '2009-07-08 21:54:48.000000', NULL, 0),
