(5566146, 801093, 76335, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by ColemanGariety:</b></div><hr/><i> This is obviously fake and not much effort was put into this.. 3/10 </i></td></tr></table> <br/>What?! You mean this isn''t <i>really</i> a dinosaur??! What a rip. And to think I gave this crap a six!</td>', 'Originally posted by ColemanGariety: This is obviously fake and not much effort was put into this.. 3/10  What?! You mean this isn''t really a dinosaur??! What a rip. And to think I gave this crap a six!', '2009-07-08 22:45:29.000000', NULL, 0),
