(5566673, 802830, 56880, '<td valign="top">Here''s the original:<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=801361" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/55000-59999/56880/120/801361.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/55000-59999/56880/120/801361.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/55000-59999/56880/120/801361.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>I thought it was too dark on the left for DPC, so I had mucked with it to bring out that side of the face a bit.  Personally I like the half-look, and I''ve been meaning to try to get a self portrait in that style.</td>', 'Here''s the original:  I thought it was too dark on the left for DPC, so I had mucked with it to bring out that side of the face a bit.  Personally I like the half-look, and I''ve been meaning to try to get a self portrait in that style.', '2009-07-09 11:35:54.000000', NULL, 0),
