(5566693, 802531, 83313, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by ColemanGariety:</b></div><hr/><i> You need a little help taking pictures! </i></td></tr></table> <br/>And someone else needs a little help with leaving polite comments.</td>', 'Originally posted by ColemanGariety: You need a little help taking pictures!  And someone else needs a little help with leaving polite comments.', '2009-07-09 12:07:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(5566706, 802179, 83313, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by ColemanGariety:</b></div><hr/><i> On this site we prefer to rate things on effort, not content.</i></td></tr></table> <br/>Just because a member does not care for this, it is not fair to presume it lacked effort. I also disagree with the statement in general. The end result is what wins on this site, and is what matters in the real world. I can point out many high scoring photos that took minimal effort and many low scoring entries that took a lot of work, but did not come off with broad appeal. The point is to interpret the feedback and then decide for yourself if your entry was really lacking, or if you hit the intended target audience with it.</td>', 'Originally posted by ColemanGariety: On this site we prefer to rate things on effort, not content. Just because a member does not care for this, it is not fair to presume it lacked effort. I also disagree with the statement in general. The end result is what wins on this site, and is what matters in the real world. I can point out many high scoring photos that took minimal effort and many low scoring entries that took a lot of work, but did not come off with broad appeal. The point is to interpret the feedback and then decide for yourself if your entry was really lacking, or if you hit the intended target audience with it.', '2009-07-09 12:18:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(5566714, 803565, 83313, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by ColemanGariety:</b></div><hr/><i> Get a hair brush moron! </i></td></tr></table> <br/>A little diplomacy goes a long way. Mr. Gariety should learn some.<br/> <br/>Looks good, Marc, your edits to it really did well. A mid 5 for a freestudy is a darn good showing in my book. The hair IS wild, but that''s high fashion and is what makes this shot Stand out.</td>', 'Originally posted by ColemanGariety: Get a hair brush moron!  A little diplomacy goes a long way. Mr. Gariety should learn some. Looks good, Marc, your edits to it really did well. A mid 5 for a freestudy is a darn good showing in my book. The hair IS wild, but that''s high fashion and is what makes this shot Stand out.', '2009-07-09 12:31:24.000000', NULL, 0),
