(5571899, 803281, 69668, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Melethia:</b></div><hr/><i> The seniors you shoot are amazingly fortunate - they have incredible, glamourous photos to remember this time in their lives by.  I doubt any of them will ever look better than they do in your photographs. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you so much.  Your words are so kind.  I appreciate it!!</td>', 'Originally posted by Melethia: The seniors you shoot are amazingly fortunate - they have incredible, glamourous photos to remember this time in their lives by.  I doubt any of them will ever look better than they do in your photographs.   Thank you so much.  Your words are so kind.  I appreciate it!!', '2009-07-13 22:09:13.000000', NULL, 0),
