(5572434, 796866, 62357, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club<br/> <br/>I can see what you are trying to do with this image, only sadly, I don''t think it works too well.  If this was for a different challenge I''m sure you would have scored much higher.  Technically the image is OK, although I might be tempted to boost the midtones a bit with a levels adjustment.  I took the liberty of tweaking it myself in Photoshop and did manage to make it pop a little bit more.<br/> <br/>I think the main reason you didn''t make it to a 5, is the subject matter. This is the Free Study and typically there is an incredibly high standard of excellent images every month.  To score well in a free study, you do really need to have an image that will wow the voters, sadly this does not do that, even if it is a perfectly competent photograph.<br/> <br/>Sarah</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club I can see what you are trying to do with this image, only sadly, I don''t think it works too well.  If this was for a different challenge I''m sure you would have scored much higher.  Technically the image is OK, although I might be tempted to boost the midtones a bit with a levels adjustment.  I took the liberty of tweaking it myself in Photoshop and did manage to make it pop a little bit more. I think the main reason you didn''t make it to a 5, is the subject matter. This is the Free Study and typically there is an incredibly high standard of excellent images every month.  To score well in a free study, you do really need to have an image that will wow the voters, sadly this does not do that, even if it is a perfectly competent photograph. Sarah', '2009-07-14 04:15:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(5572441, 803488, 62357, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club<br/> <br/>First of all, many congratulations on the blue ribbon! <br/> <br/>Now you have made my job very difficult, for how am I supposed to critique the top scoring image in this Free Study.<br/> <br/>Composition, colours editing all are excellent. I don''t know what you could possibly do to improve it.</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club First of all, many congratulations on the blue ribbon!  Now you have made my job very difficult, for how am I supposed to critique the top scoring image in this Free Study. Composition, colours editing all are excellent. I don''t know what you could possibly do to improve it.', '2009-07-14 04:48:33.000000', NULL, 0),
