(5572507, 803140, 93565, '<td valign="top">As I said before... I think your lensbaby work is far above and beyond the others here. Again, I commend you for your incredible capture and perfectly placed focus point. For many, the lensbaby is simply another tool that is misunderstood. You, on the other hand, know exactly when to utilize it. Well done, and I hope you will continue to sway me towards the lensbaby!:)</td>', 'As I said before... I think your lensbaby work is far above and beyond the others here. Again, I commend you for your incredible capture and perfectly placed focus point. For many, the lensbaby is simply another tool that is misunderstood. You, on the other hand, know exactly when to utilize it. Well done, and I hope you will continue to sway me towards the lensbaby!:)', '2009-07-14 07:52:32.000000', NULL, 0),
