(5640434, 802290, 69008, '<td valign="top">Cool processing to accent all the little details of this critter''s skin.  These things are so fearsome looking, but actually are not aggressive at all. I used to have a couple as pets. <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=674006" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/65000-69999/69008/120/674006.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/65000-69999/69008/120/674006.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/65000-69999/69008/120/674006.jpg"/></a> <br/></td>', 'Cool processing to accent all the little details of this critter''s skin.  These things are so fearsome looking, but actually are not aggressive at all. I used to have a couple as pets.  ', '2009-09-08 12:17:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(5640628, 802290, 66384, '<td valign="top">Great pose and crop -- very strong. It seems a bit dark on my monitor. I wonder if you could put a little more light on his face, perhaps with filter&gt;render&gt;lighting effects&gt;omni light? Or a white soft light brush with very low opacity.</td>', 'Great pose and crop -- very strong. It seems a bit dark on my monitor. I wonder if you could put a little more light on his face, perhaps with filter>render>lighting effects>omni light? Or a white soft light brush with very low opacity.', '2009-09-08 16:20:23.000000', NULL, 0),
