(5701276, 802633, 30982, '<td valign="top">Huge congrats on the new Personal Best - that''s a kick-butt kinda score especially in a Free Study!  I had one of these pretty things in my garden in Texas - she had an egg sack, it hatched, and I watched the little ones get bigger.</td>', 'Huge congrats on the new Personal Best - that''s a kick-butt kinda score especially in a Free Study!  I had one of these pretty things in my garden in Texas - she had an egg sack, it hatched, and I watched the little ones get bigger.', '2009-10-26 17:16:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(5701357, 802633, 12250, '<td valign="top">Thank you!  This spider loved taking pictures.  I entered it in the Michael Jackson <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=804884" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1059/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_804884.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1059/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_804884.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1059/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_804884.jpg"/></a> and Life and Death <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=809404" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1070/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_809404.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1070/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_809404.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1070/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_809404.jpg"/></a>.  I took many other pics as well that weren''t posted that turned out great.  Every morning it was ready for another meal.  It did really well for itself.  I didn''t have the privelage of seeing eggs and babies.  Must''ve been exciting.<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Melethia:</b></div><hr/><i> Huge congrats on the new Personal Best - that''s a kick-butt kinda score especially in a Free Study!  I had one of these pretty things in my garden in Texas - she had an egg sack, it hatched, and I watched the little ones get bigger. </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'Thank you!  This spider loved taking pictures.  I entered it in the Michael Jackson  and Life and Death .  I took many other pics as well that weren''t posted that turned out great.  Every morning it was ready for another meal.  It did really well for itself.  I didn''t have the privelage of seeing eggs and babies.  Must''ve been exciting. Originally posted by Melethia: Huge congrats on the new Personal Best - that''s a kick-butt kinda score especially in a Free Study!  I had one of these pretty things in my garden in Texas - she had an egg sack, it hatched, and I watched the little ones get bigger. ', '2009-10-26 19:04:54.000000', NULL, 0),
