(6012413, 802966, 36999, '<td valign="top">Having just recently navigated the Madrid airport, awesome pic of it.  My first trip through was nearly a nightmare.  (even with 2 hours to do it)  On the return trip I had a 5 hour layover and actually got to look around.  Pretty neat architecture but  I didn''t take any pics and I''m not sure why I didn''t.</td>', 'Having just recently navigated the Madrid airport, awesome pic of it.  My first trip through was nearly a nightmare.  (even with 2 hours to do it)  On the return trip I had a 5 hour layover and actually got to look around.  Pretty neat architecture but  I didn''t take any pics and I''m not sure why I didn''t.', '2010-05-18 03:57:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(6024957, 802698, 43298, '<td valign="top">I am usually not that into landscapes, but I think this is really awesome. I just came across it and I think it is one of the most beautiful scenes I have seen. Wow.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-05-24 21:19:35.</i></td>', 'I am usually not that into landscapes, but I think this is really awesome. I just came across it and I think it is one of the most beautiful scenes I have seen. Wow.', '2010-05-24 22:19:14.000000', '2010-05-24 22:19:35.000000', 0),
