(6100470, 803155, 98339, '<td valign="top">I gave you a 10 in this challenge....this is so very clear and precise that it almost looks fake...such a superb job</td>', 'I gave you a 10 in this challenge....this is so very clear and precise that it almost looks fake...such a superb job', '2010-07-22 00:08:59.000000', NULL, 0),
