(6109707, 803291, 40718, '<td valign="top">Wonderful scene and composition.  I think your camera may have let you down or you were forced to underexpose due to being handheld(?).  There is a lot of color noise showing up in the shadows (primarily the columns).  The blues contrast nicely with the yellows.  I get a sense of the complexity, beauty and mystery of God.</td>', 'Wonderful scene and composition.  I think your camera may have let you down or you were forced to underexpose due to being handheld(?).  There is a lot of color noise showing up in the shadows (primarily the columns).  The blues contrast nicely with the yellows.  I get a sense of the complexity, beauty and mystery of God.', '2010-07-30 17:26:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(6120610, 803486, 8891, '<td valign="top">Great shot, Neil! Love the sky!  See ya tomorrow!</td>', 'Great shot, Neil! Love the sky!  See ya tomorrow!', '2010-08-06 12:48:21.000000', NULL, 0);
