(6797783, 798038, 83901, '<td valign="top">hmm</td>', 'hmm', '2012-06-18 22:42:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(6822648, 803298, 69008, '<td valign="top">The LB was a great choice for this scene.  The dreamy edge brings you right to the subject, and the colt with the spraddled legs gets a grin. <br/>Shooting with unusual or home-brew lenses holds a certain fascination for me.</td>', 'The LB was a great choice for this scene.  The dreamy edge brings you right to the subject, and the colt with the spraddled legs gets a grin. Shooting with unusual or home-brew lenses holds a certain fascination for me.', '2012-07-20 14:10:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(6857729, 801254, 69008, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, and I like having the BG in the shot as well. Looking at very old B&amp;W photos, there are sometimes things of historical interest in the BG, like cars, signs, buildings, the way people dress ect that mean more to me than the main subject in the image.  There''s not much in the BG in this one that would fit that category, but it''s a good street shot none the less. <br/>I don''t know whose move it is, but it''s going to get messy pretty soon here. My bet is on black if it''s his move.</td>', 'Nice shot, and I like having the BG in the shot as well. Looking at very old B&W photos, there are sometimes things of historical interest in the BG, like cars, signs, buildings, the way people dress ect that mean more to me than the main subject in the image.  There''s not much in the BG in this one that would fit that category, but it''s a good street shot none the less. I don''t know whose move it is, but it''s going to get messy pretty soon here. My bet is on black if it''s his move.', '2012-09-06 01:47:06.000000', NULL, 0),
